  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 05d4c58a8777a554f9643c64e852e28a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Data_Kratos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterData
  characterNameEN: Kratos
  characterNameES: Kratos
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  sceneName: 
  originEN: Kratos is a Spartan warrior who first appeared in the original God of
    War (2005). Tricked by the god Ares into killing his own family, he is marked
    by their ashes and becomes known as the "Ghost of Sparta." He later learns he
    is the son of Zeus.
  originES: "Kratos es un guerrero espartano que apareci\xF3 por primera vez en el
    God of War original (2005). Enga\xF1ado por el dios Ares para matar a su propia
    familia, queda marcado por sus cenizas y es conocido como el \"Fantasma de Esparta.\"
    M\xE1s tarde descubre que es hijo de Zeus."
  historyEN: After killing Ares and taking his place as God of War, Kratos turns
    against the Olympian gods in a quest for vengeance. In the 2018 reboot, he lives
    in the Norse realms with his son Atreus, trying to control his rage and become
    a better father while they travel to scatter his wife's ashes.
  historyES: "Tras matar a Ares y ocupar su lugar como Dios de la Guerra, Kratos
    se enfrenta a los dioses del Olimpo en busca de venganza. En el reinicio de 2018
    vive en los reinos n\xF3rdicos con su hijo Atreus, intentando controlar su ira
    y ser un mejor padre mientras viajan para esparcir las cenizas de su esposa."
  abilitiesEN: Superhuman strength and Spartan Rage, a state of fury that boosts
    his attacks. He fights with the Blades of Chaos (chained blades wielded with
    fire), and in the Norse saga with the Leviathan Axe, which he can throw and recall,
    and the Guardian Shield.
  abilitiesES: "Fuerza sobrehumana e Ira Espartana, un estado de furia que potencia
    sus ataques. Combate con las Hojas del Caos (espadas encadenadas envueltas en
    fuego) y, en la saga n\xF3rdica, con el Hacha Leviat\xE1n, que puede lanzar y
    recuperar, y el Escudo Guardi\xE1n."
  universeEN: "The franchise began in a world based on Greek mythology, with Olympus,
    the Underworld, and its gods and titans. The 2018 saga moves Kratos to Norse
    mythology, exploring the Nine Realms, Midgard, and the events leading to Ragnar\xF6k."
  universeES: "La franquicia comenz\xF3 en un mundo basado en la mitolog\xEDa griega,
    con el Olimpo, el Inframundo, sus dioses y titanes. La saga de 2018 traslada
    a Kratos a la mitolog\xEDa n\xF3rdica, explorando los Nueve Reinos, Midgard y
    los eventos que llevan al Ragnar\xF6k."
  creatorsEN: Created by David Jaffe and developed by Santa Monica Studio, published
    by Sony Interactive Entertainment for PlayStation. The 2018 reboot was directed
    by Cory Barlog.
  creatorsES: Creado por David Jaffe y desarrollado por Santa Monica Studio, publicado
    por Sony Interactive Entertainment para PlayStation. El reinicio de 2018 fue
    dirigido por Cory Barlog.
  culturalImpactEN: Kratos is one of PlayStation's most recognizable icons. God of
    War (2018) won Game of the Year at The Game Awards, and its portrayal of Kratos
    evolving from a rage-driven anti-hero into a complex father was widely praised
    for its storytelling and emotional depth.
  culturalImpactES: "Kratos es uno de los \xEDconos m\xE1s reconocibles de PlayStation.
    God of War (2018) gan\xF3 el premio a Juego del A\xF1o en The Game Awards, y
    su retrato de Kratos, que evoluciona de un antih\xE9roe movido por la ira a un
    padre complejo, fue elogiado por su narrativa y profundidad emocional."
